{"id":"629403","name":"肉松发面饼","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629403/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"水","amount":"170克"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"少量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"},{"name":"肉松","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"少量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克面粉，3克酵母，少量白糖混合。","img":"images/629403/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用170克水和面，和成光滑的面团。","img":"images/629403/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉成条。","img":"images/629403/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切剂子。","img":"images/629403/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切口朝上，按扁。","img":"images/629403/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放上肉松。","img":"images/629403/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/629403/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"光滑的一面抹点水粘上白芝麻。","img":"images/629403/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"按扁。","img":"images/629403/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"码电饼铛里边发酵。","img":"images/629403/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"明显变大以后上下火，用3档烙，直接烙表面不刷油。","img":"images/629403/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"中间需要翻翻面，我家的电饼铛下盘火力比较大点儿。","img":"images/629403/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"一款孩子喜欢的发面馅饼完成。","img":"images/629403/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}